{"blocks": [{"type": "paragraph", "text": "こんにちは\n井上和です\nお久しぶりです"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "2月\n5期生もついに5年目に突入します。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "今日までの4年は早かったように感じてしまうけれど、\n加入したばかりの記憶は、もうところどころ思い出せない部分があったりします。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "悲しいかな。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://www.nogizaka46.com/files/46/diary/n46/MEMBER/moblog/202602/mobPXF5qC.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://www.nogizaka46.com/files/46/diary/n46/MEMBER/moblog/202602/mobr5yxmw.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://www.nogizaka46.com/files/46/diary/n46/MEMBER/moblog/202602/mob0EhxoL.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://www.nogizaka46.com/files/46/diary/n46/MEMBER/moblog/202602/mobhFDLU0.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "一瞬一瞬を大切に生きていきたい5年目。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "まだまだやりたいこと、みんなと叶えたいこと、たくさんあるから、\nもっと頑張らなくてはね！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "今日までに私と出会ってくれたみんな、\n本当にありがとう。\nあなたのおかげで頑張れた瞬間がたくさんありました。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "5年目の5期生を、\n5年目の井上和を、\nどうかよろしくお願いします"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://www.nogizaka46.com/files/46/diary/n46/MEMBER/moblog/202602/mobQHAtNq.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "それでは\nまたね"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "和"}], "source": "official"}